    "chunk_text": "sceaphyrdan: Sceaphyrdes riht is, \u00fe\u00e6t he h\u00e6bbe twelf nihta dingan to Middanwintra & I lamb of Be gathyrde: Gathyrde gebyre\u00f0 his heorde meolc ofer Martinus m\u00e6ssed\u00e6ig, & \u00e6r \u00f0am his d\u00e6l hw\u00e6ges Be cyswyrhte: Cyswyrhtan gebyre\u00f0 hundred cyse, & \u00fe\u00e6t heo of wringhw\u00e6ge buteran macige to Be berebrytte: Berebryttan gebyre\u00f0 corngebrot on h\u00e6rfeste \u00e6t bernes dure, gif him his ealdorman ann, Be bydele: Bydele gebyra\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he for his wycan sy weorces frigra \u00f0onne o\u00f0er man; for\u00f0an he sceal Eac him gebyre\u00f0 sum landsticce for his geswince. Be wudewarde: Wuduwearde gebyre\u00f0 \u00e6lc windfylled treow. H\u00e6igwerde gebyre\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t man his geswinces lean gecnawe on \u00f0am endum, \u00f0e to etenl\u00e6se licgan; Hwilces landsticces geann, \u00fe\u00e6t sceal beon mid folcrihte nyhst etenl\u00e6se; for\u00f0am gyf he for sl\u00e6w\u00f0e his Gyf he \u00f0onne eal wel gefri\u00f0a\u00f0, he healdan sceal, \u00f0onne bi\u00f0 he godes leanes ful wel wyr\u00f0e. Landlaga syn mistlice, swa ic \u00e6r beforan s\u00e6de. Ne sette we na \u00f0as gerihtu ofer ealle \u00f0eoda, \u00f0e we \u00e6r beforan ymbe spr\u00e6con; ac we cy\u00f0a\u00f0, hw\u00e6t Gyf we selre geleornia\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t we willa\u00f0 georne lufian & healdon, be \u00f0\u00e6re \u00f0ede \u00f0eawe, \u00f0e we \u00f0\u00e6nne For\u00f0am",
